-- CONSTRAINED FUNCTIONS -------------------------------------------------------

This program has functions whose type annotation has a `where` block of
constraints:

    Main.sum

They are not supported in the JavaScript output yet: the member functions that
such a function needs would have to be passed to it when the program runs, and
how the JavaScript output does that is not decided.

The C output supports them (every use is compiled for its own types, so the
members are called directly). Compile with an output file that ends in `.c`:

    elm make src/Main.elm --output=main.c
